<tei:p><tei:pb n="790" ed="1949 concluding_prayers" facs="https://archive.org/download/PhilipBirnbaumHaSiddurHaShalemTheDailyPrayerBook1949/page/n814_medium.jpg"/><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tefillah_lishlom_medinat_yisrael/1"/>Our Father who art in heaven, Protector and Redeemer of Israel, bless thou the State of Israel which marks the dawn of our deliverance. Shield it beneath the wings of thy love; spread over it thy canopy of peace; send thy light and thy truth to its leaders, officers and counselors, and direct them with thy good counsel.<tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
